e sequential path no longer has. That left the aggregates\npackage with no unit tests at all, so the four conditional gates in find()\nand the merge that keys attributes, enrollments and programOwners back onto\ntheir tracked entity have nothing asserting they behave as claimed. That\nclaim -- semantic equivalence with the fan-out -- is the whole point of the\nchange, so it is what a test should hold.\n\nAdd a Mockito unit test over mocked TrackedEntityStore and EnrollmentAggregate\ncovering: each of the three field gates skips its fetch when off and runs it\nexactly once when on, while getTrackedEntities always runs; an empty\nidentifier list short-circuits without touching a collaborator; the merge\nassigns each tracked entity its own attributes, enrollments and programOwners\nacross two tracked entities; getAttributes gets the program id when\nenrolledInTrackerProgram is set and null when it is not; and an expired\nDeadlineHolder deadline makes find() throw before any fetch.\n\nNothing here asserts timing, ordering between the fetches or anything\nthread-related -- the gating and merge semantics are what the change has to\npreserve, not the scheduling.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"},"id":"29df54bf778ca8606c5d8c1123681e93cf4eb52e","tree_id":"93b6419eeda6b19702f2248396eda67bdb197ee2","timestamp":"2026-09-11T13:05:35Z","committer":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api